{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45666","headline":"送张拾遗赴施州司户 · 贯休","name":"送张拾遗赴施州司户","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道之大道古太古，二字爲名争莽卤。\n社稷安危在直言，须历尧堦挝谏鼓。\n恭闻吾皇至圣深无比，推席却几听至理。\n一言偶未合尧聪，贾生须看湘江水。\n君不见顷者百官排闼赴延英，阳城不死存令名。\n又不见仲尼遥奇司马子，佩玉垂绅合如此。\n公乎公乎施之掾，江上春风喜相见。\n畏天之命复行行，芙蓉爲衣胜絁绢。\n好音入耳应非久，三峡闻猨莫回首。\n且啜千年羹，醉巴酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}